    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d49-a2">

                <pb facs="0363" n="149" sameAs="frus:frus1871/pg149"/>

                <head>No. 2.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Corea</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1871-06-22"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi>
                            22.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Washington</hi>.</p>
                <p>Recent demonstration produced no effect upon negotiations. Nothing can be
                    effected short of the capital. Force insufficient to go there without great
                    risk. If peaceful means fail, shall withdraw and wait instructions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LOW.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>True copy, <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edw’d B. Drew.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
